nd call Bill Clinton a rapist $5,000. So basically, these people are just trying to get paid   much like Trump himself.On the upside, it looks like Hillary can t be rattled by anything Trump and his pathetic Trump supporters do at this point!Featured image via Joe Raedle / Getty Images. Answer:

