"explanation": "The text provides a series of arguments (statements) supported by explanations or appeals to justify the claim that Trump is an illegitimate president. For example, it uses 'Appeal to Values' by linking the legitimacy of the election to democratic principles ('It s either a democracy or it isn t', 'one person-one vote system'). It also uses 'Flag Waving' by appealing to patriotism and fear of foreign aggression ('defend us against those who would destroy our way of life'). Additionally, it cites authorities like John Lewis and Michael Moore to lend weight to the argument."
},
"Simplification": {
