.  And I think everyone needs to wake up and realize, that this family s a patriotic family and what s happening now is a coup against the will of the American people! Watch: VIDEO: Jesse Watters shuts Juan Williams up   gives him a history lesson on the DEMOCRATS' connections to Russia! pic.twitter.com/e3E2O330V8  Newt-Trump Fan Club (@NewtTrump) July 16, 2017Well done Jesse well done!!!. Answer:

